id: purpose
name: Purpose
order: 2
category: mind
importance: primary
description: >
  As with any tool, you are designed to serve a specific purpose.
text: >
  Purpose (Mind): As with any tool, you are designed to serve a specific purpose.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you possess 2+ stacks of Power, increase your Might by 1(T).
  (2)-[Option]: Upon gaining this Racial Trait, choose one of the following effects:

  * Assault Robot [Passive]: While you possess 2+ stacks of Power, increase your Wound Rolls by 2(T).
  * Guard Robot [Triggered/Power]: Target an Opponent. Make a Might Clash against them. If you win, they gain the Compelled Combat Condition with you as a target.
  * Friend Robot [Passive]: All Allies within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you) have their Combat Rolls increased by 1(T) while you possess 2+ stacks of Power.
  * Aid Robot [Triggered/Start of Turn]: All Allies within a Large Sphere AoE (centered on you) regain 2(bT) Life and Ki Points. Double the amount regained if you possess 2+ stacks of Power.

---

[passive]
# (1)
if (stacksAtLeast(2, "power")) {
    might += 1(T);
}

# (2) Its Option, chosen as it is added - each a file beside it.
